content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Install dns package\n  package:\n    name: dns\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create directories\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item.path }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: "{{ item.mode }}"\n    owner: "{{ item.owner }}"\n    group: "{{ item.group }}"\n  loop: "{{ directories }}"\n\n- name: Create group\n  group:\n    name: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create user\n  user:\n    name: "{{ dns_user }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    system: yes\n    create_home: no\n\n- name: Generate rndc key file\n  shell: rndc-confgen -a -r /dev/urandom\n  args:\n    creates: /etc/rndc.key\n\n- name: Set permissions on rndc key file\n  file:\n    path: /etc/rndc.key\n    owner: root\n    group: named\n    mode: \'0640\'\n\n- name: Get the hints/root file\n  get_url:\n    url: "{{ hints_root_url }}"\n    dest: /etc/bind/named.root\n    mode: \'0644\'\n\n- name: Create zone files\n  template:\n    src: zone.j2\n    dest: "/etc/bind/zones/{{ item.name }}.zone"\n  loop: "{{ dns_zones }}"\n\n- name: Add zones to configuration\n  template:\n    src: named.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/bind/named.conf\n    mode: \'0644\'\n\n- name: Place systemd override\n  template:\n    src: systemd-overrides.j2\n    dest: /etc/systemd/system/named.service.d/override.conf\n\n- name: Start and enable dns service\n  systemd:\n    name: named\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n```\n\nThis playbook includes all tasks as specified, with precise names and ordering, ready to be included in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/main.yml` directory.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T20:04:30.852782347Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 5765728685, 'load_duration': 64852305, 'prompt_eval_count': 521, 'prompt_eval_duration': 50884658, 'eval_count': 433, 'eval_duration': 5648652709, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--dd422929-f5f9-4253-874