content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Install required packages\n  package:\n    name: "{{ required_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Configure systemd service\n  template:\n    src: service_systemd.j2\n    dest: /etc/systemd/system/{{ service_name }}.service\n  when: ansible_service_mgr == "systemd"\n  notify: Reload systemd\n\n- name: Configure sysvinit service\n  template:\n    src: service_init.j2\n    dest: /etc/init/{{ service_name }}.conf\n  when: ansible_service_mgr in ["sysvinit", "upstart", "openrc"]\n  notify: Restart service\n\n- name: Manage service\n  service:\n    name: "{{ item.name }}"\n    state: "{{ item.state }}"\n    enabled: "{{ item.enabled }}"\n  loop: "{{ service_list }}"\n  loop_control:\n    label: "{{ item.name }}"\n\n- name: Flush handlers\n  meta: flush_handlers\n```\n\nThis YAML playbook is structured to be included in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/` directory, adhering to your specified instructions. Each task is named and ordered as described, with conditions and modules applied as required.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T20:06:11.139148297Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 4254169303, 'load_duration': 62225754, 'prompt_eval_count': 428, 'prompt_eval_duration': 44731640, 'eval_count': 259, 'eval_duration': 4146205571, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--11d05a27-3bc9-41b9-8d53-eb3c917187e7-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 428, 'output_tokens': 259, 'total_tokens': 687}
